@startuml
[*] --> ManageZones : User starts managing zones
[*] --> ManageScenes : User starts managing scenes
ManageZones --> [*] : User finishes managing zones
ManageScenes --> [*] : User finishes managing scenes
ManageZones --> CreateZone : User creates a new zone
ManageZones --> EditZone : User edits an existing zone
ManageZones --> DeleteZone : User deletes a zone
ManageScenes --> CreateScene : User creates a new scene
ManageScenes --> EditScene : User edits an existing scene
ManageScenes --> DeleteScene : User deletes a scene
CreateZone --> [*] : Zone creation completed
EditZone --> [*] : Zone editing completed
DeleteZone --> [*] : Zone deletion completed
CreateScene --> [*] : Scene creation completed
EditScene --> [*] : Scene editing completed
DeleteScene --> [*] : Scene deletion completed
[*] --> MonitorDevices : System monitors devices
MonitorDevices --> [*] : Monitoring completes
[*] --> TriggerScene : User triggers a scene
TriggerScene --> ActiveScene : Scene becomes active
ActiveScene --> [*] : Scene stops
@enduml
